===Etymology===
From {{etyl|NL.}} {{term|lang=la|rectum}}, abbreviation of {{etyl|la}} {{term|lang=la||rectum intestinum|the straight intestine}}, {{term|lang=la|rectum}}, neuter of {{term|lang=la|rectus||straight}}. See [[right]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|recta|pl2=rectums}}

# {{anatomy}} The [[terminal]] part of the large [[intestine]] through which feces pass.

